{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"Stall after stall, the air grew thicker with the scent of salt and crushed oranges, mingling with the damp chill of the river that bordered the town. Bent bursts of color—crimson peppers, leafy greens, yellow lemons—were piled high in wooden crates, creating a vibrant tapestry against the grey cobblestones. A stray cat weaved through the legs of the crowd, indifferent to the haggling erupted from every corner of the square. Old men in wool caps leaned against their goods, eyes closed in slumber or watching the flow of people with a detached, practiced calm, while young vendors hurried to stack their wares before the sun climbed higher and the heat drove the delicate blooms to wilt. It was a noisy, chaotic symphony of commerce and survival, distinct yet unchanging, marking the rhythm of the town from the first light until the shadows stretched long across the stones.","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1792461394,"id":"chatcmpl-18e01a241c4d9cb70079","model":"qwen3.8-27b-fp8","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"aien_sampling":{"greedy_tokens":0,"kept":[248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320